    {
      "id": "first-setup", "category": "Getting started",
      "question": "How is the temple created the first time?",
      "variants": ["First time setup", "Welcome setup screen", "Create shop and admin", "Initial setup"],
      "tags": ["first-time setup", "welcome", "state", "gstin"],
      "answer": "The first time the app is opened, **Welcome — first-time setup** appears:\n1. Enter the temple name and choose the **State** (decides CGST+SGST or IGST).\n2. GSTIN is optional; a valid GSTIN selects the state.\n3. Fill in address, city and phone (printed on bills) and the financial-year start (normally 1 April).\n4. Choose the admin user name and a password (8+ characters with letters and digits).\n5. Click **Create temple**.\n\nAccount groups, Cash/Bank/Sales/Purchase/GST ledgers and a “Cash Customer” are created automatically. No default password ships."
    },
