      "link": "/settings/license",
      "answer": "Open **Settings › License**. It shows the subscription length (for example 1 month, 1 year or Lifetime), the **Valid until** date, the number of users and the **Key ID**. A yellow bar appears at the top of every screen in the last 30 days before the license ends."
    },
    {
      "id": "license-renew", "category": "License",
      "question": "How do I renew my license?",
      "variants": ["License expired", "Renew subscription", "Enter new license key", "Apply license key", "Cannot save bill license expired", "Subscription ended"],
      "tags": ["license", "renew", "key", "expired", "nas1"],
      "link": "/settings/license",
      "answer": "1. Contact Kshethra Mithra support with your **temple name**, **GSTIN** (if any) and the **Key ID** shown in Settings › License.\n2. You'll receive a new key starting with **NAS1-**.\n3. An administrator opens **Settings › License**, pastes the key and clicks **Apply key**.\n\nBilling works again immediately. While the license is expired, new bills, purchases and vouchers can't be saved, but viewing, reports, reprints and backups still work."
    },
    {
