      "variants": ["User limit reached", "Subscription allows users", "Add more users to subscription", "Maximum users", "All user places are in use"],
      "tags": ["license", "users", "limit", "subscription"],
      "screens": ["Users"], "link": "/settings/users",
      "answer": "Your subscription key allows a fixed number of **active users** (shown in Settings › License and at the top of Settings › Users, e.g. “10 of 10 active”). When all places are used, a new user can't be added or a disabled one re-activated.\n- Free a place: untick **Active** on a user who no longer needs access.\n- Need more users: contact Kshethra Mithra support for a new subscription with more users and apply the new key in **Settings › License**."
    },
