      "answer": "Go to **Settings › Print Schemes**, choose a bill type and change the paper (A4, A5, Thermal 3 inch (80 mm), Thermal 2 inch (58 mm)), heading, columns and footer lines. A 3 inch thermal printer uses the 80 mm setting. POS uses Thermal 3 inch (80 mm) by default. For vazhipadu receipts, set the paper, **Cut print** (a separate cut slip per offering), **duplicate** copies and **Ask before printing** under **Temple › Vazhipadu Print Settings**; the donation receipt paper is under **Temple**. Turn on **Regional item names** to also print Malayalam names."
